  "description": "Phula is a long play station that children travel along from one end to the other. Wooden arch towers are linked by a tube tunnel, a curved stepping ladder and an arched net climber, and slides including a spiral tube slide bring them down. At 37'2\" x 15'3\", with a safe play area of 42'2\" x 20'3\", it is the longest piece in our Nature Sparsh collection and needs a large lawn or township park. It takes up to 15 children aged 5 to 12. Sliding, climbing and crawling build coordination, physical strength and creative exploration. The colours are Banana Yellow and Sand Beige. A 3-year warranty applies to its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us for a site visit plan.",
